<title>USA: Empire of Carolina names Holmes chairman.</title>
<headline>Empire of Carolina names Holmes chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire of Carolina said Tuesday it named Charles Holmes to replace Steve Geller as chairman.</p>
<p>Geller will continue to serve as chief executive officer and a director of the company and its Empire Industries Inc subsidiary.</p>
<p>Empire said the appointment follows the completion of a $16 million investment.</p>
